Package: SpaMTPdb
Type: Package
Title: Versioned Annotation Resources for SpaMTP
Version: 0.99.0
Date: 2026-08-14
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tianyao", "Lu",
           email = "lu.t@wehi.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Andrew", "Causer", role = "aut"),
    person("Quan", "Nguyen", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides lightweight, version-aware access to the annotation
    resources used by SpaMTP. Resources include pruned RaMP chemical,
    identifier, pathway, and pathway-topology tables, precomputed SMILES
    functional-group and ionisation features, and legacy metabolite reference
    tables. Large files are distributed through
    AnnotationHub rather than bundled in the package, while a local resource
    directory can be used for development and reproducible database builds.
